OL,3,AKing 'heartbroken' by deadly Nepal
OL,4,Aflash floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham said the UK
OL,7,Fhas offered #5m to help the Nepalese
OL,8,Fgovernment following the floods, adding
OL,9,Fit was a "very distressing and
OL,10,Fdevastating situation".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
