OL,3,AClean-up of illegal waste supersite
OL,4,Acosts taxpayers #6m
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe clear-up of one of England's
OL,7,Flargest illegal waste tips has been
OL,8,Fcompleted - landing taxpayers with a
OL,9,F#6m bill.
OL,11,FThe government has vowed to recoup the
OL,12,Fclearance costs for the Kidlington dump
OL,13,Fin Oxfordshire - and seven other sites
OL,14,F- from the criminals responsible.
OL,16,FIn 2025, around 22,000 tonnes of
OL,17,Fdomestic and commercial rubbish was
OL,18,Fdumped at the spot, between the River
OL,19,FCherwell and the A34. It is one of
OL,20,Fnearly 30 so-called "supersites" first
OL,21,Funcovered by a BBC investigation.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
