OL,3,ATrump administration illegally
OL,4,Aretaliated against Anthropic, judge
OL,5,Arules
OL,6,
OL,7,FA judge has ruled the US Department of
OL,8,FDefense acted unlawfully when it
OL,9,Fdesignated artificial intelligence (AI)
OL,10,Fstartup Anthropic a supply chain risk,
OL,11,Fcalling the move "illegal and
OL,12,Fbaseless".
OL,14,FThe company argued in the lawsuit that
OL,15,FDefense Secretary Pete Hegseth
OL,16,Foverstepped his authority with the new
OL,17,Fdesignation. It followed Anthropic's
OL,18,Frefusal to allow the military to use
OL,19,Fits AI models for things that included
OL,20,Fsurveillance or autonomous weapons.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
