OL,3,ATate brothers blast US jail conditions
OL,4,Aas they seek bail in UK extradition
OL,5,Afight
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndrew and Tristan Tate have told a
OL,8,FFlorida court they should be released
OL,9,Ffrom jail so they can fight extradition
OL,10,Fto the UK on charges of rape and
OL,11,Ftrafficking.
OL,13,FWearing tan jail uniforms, the brothers
OL,14,Fmaintained they did not commit the
OL,15,Falleged crimes as they slammed
OL,16,Fconditions in US custody.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
