OL,3,AWhat we know after the big Grand Theft
OL,4,AAuto 6 preview
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter more than 18 months since the
OL,7,Flast official glimpse of Grand Theft
OL,8,FAuto 6, developer Rockstar has shown
OL,9,Ffans a 26-minute preview of the
OL,10,Fupcoming blockbuster video game.
OL,12,FIts "extended look" debuted on Netflix,
OL,13,Fsix hours before going live on YouTube,
OL,14,Fand was the first chance players have
OL,15,Fhad to see detailed footage of the
OL,16,Ftitle in action.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
